  "item_short_desc": "<p>Show your support for law enforcement with Rothco&rsquo;s Women's Thin Blue Line Long Length T-Shirt. The distressed vertical Thin Blue Line flag print is a powerful symbol of respect and support for law enforcement officials and police. Crafted from a soft cotton / polyester fabric blend, this short sleeve t-shirt offers a comfortable and perfect fit, with a longer length that extends past the waist for added style and coverage.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
