  "description": "<p>Show your support for law enforcement with Rothco&rsquo;s Women's Thin Blue Line Long Length T-Shirt. The distressed vertical Thin Blue Line flag print is a powerful symbol of respect and support for law enforcement officials and police. Crafted from a soft cotton / polyester fabric blend, this short sleeve t-shirt offers a comfortable and perfect fit, with a longer length that extends past the waist for added style and coverage. Designed with a tag-less label for added comfort, this shirt is as functional as it is stylish. Whether you're wearing it casually or layering it under a jacket, this patriotic t-shirt is a versatile addition to your wardrobe. In addition, proceeds from the purchase of this shirt benefit families of fallen first responders, making it a meaningful way to show your appreciation.</p>",
